16029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小桃源图为韩寅仲先生 其一","author":"倪元璐","text":"松风忽过小溪湾，长出仇池石一班。\n不问已知天地别，神仙自合享三山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25411,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小桃源图为韩寅仲先生 其二","author":"倪元璐","text":"桃花流水隐双凫，中有高真彻晓呼。\n人是右丞诗是画，袛应唤作辋川图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25412,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小桃源图为韩寅仲先生 其三","author":"倪元璐","text":"王维石室鲁菟裘，一日山居一日侯。\n试到顽仙楼上看，可知李白醉时不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25413,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小桃源图为韩寅仲先生 其四","author":"倪元璐","text":"天上元灵曲奏来，何因人世奖仙才。\n正如渡口溪风便，流出胡麻饭一杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25414,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小桃源图为韩寅仲先生 其五","author":"倪元璐","text":"携将琴鹤过夷门，比勘温公独乐园。\n圣世遭逢无避理，不应题是小桃源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25415,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王觉斯石交图为郭天门吏部","author":"倪元璐","text":"千夫舁不上丹徒，看有模棱物态无。\n交尽世人惟得此，资他风骨耐他粗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25416,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画石送姚孟长前辈","author":"倪元璐","text":"总欺学学与尧尧，唤作天门第一桥。\n待到中流人共晓，莫将深浅问江潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25417,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈章侯南还暨阳 其一","author":"倪元璐","text":"不堪云乱雨长离，凄绝蕉风夜动时。\n此意自难将作赋，江淹多是未曾知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25418,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈章侯南还暨阳 其二","author":"倪元璐","text":"有我君何易别离，酒浓诗酽夜深时。\n可当一片韩陵石，归去逢人尽说知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25419,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈章侯南还暨阳 其三","author":"倪元璐","text":"玉鞭在手眼迷离，是写芭蕉怪石时。\n供作丹徒书院谱，世间只有米颠知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25420,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画石为罗萸江前辈","author":"倪元璐","text":"自由体正见嶙峋，端为滔滔现此身。\n珍重好加炉火炼，世间原有补天人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25421,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松石寿吴澹人母杨夫人","author":"倪元璐","text":"骊山老母石长在，华岭玉姜松愈芬。\n十二灵飞篇烂熟，传经偶尔号宣文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25422,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洗儿词为王季重","author":"倪元璐","text":"笑到双颧舞到眉，桃花雪水洗儿时。\n生金铸就新孩子，提向罡风一任吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25423,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]